{"text":"kuruntokai","n":18,"lines":["வேரல் வேலி வேர்க்கோட் பலவின்","சாரல் நாட செவ்வியை ஆகுமதி","யாரஃ தறிந்திசி னோரே சாரல்","சிறுகோட்டுப் பெரும்பழந் தூங்கி யாங்கிவள்","உயிர்தவச் சிறிது காமமோ பெரிதே"],"tr":["vēral vēli vērkkōṭ palaviṉ","cāral nāṭa cevviyai ākumati","yāraḵ taṟintici ṉōrē cāral","ciṟukōṭṭup perumpaḻan tūṅki yāṅkivaḷ","uyirtavac ciṟitu kāmamō peritē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தோழி கூற்று","poet_ta":"கபிலர்","speaker_en":"her friend (tōḻi)","poet_tr":"Kapilar"},"scan":{"meter":"nilaimaṇṭila āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"5×4 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 18, veṇcīr 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 11, veṇṭaḷai 7, kalittaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"வேரல்","tr":"vēral","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரல்","tr":"ral"}]},{"text":"வேலி","tr":"vēli","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வே","tr":"vē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லி","tr":"li"}]},{"text":"வேர்க்கோட்","tr":"vērkkōṭ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வேர்க்","tr":"vērk"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கோட்","tr":"kōṭ"}]},{"text":"பலவின்","tr":"palaviṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பல","tr":"pala"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வின்","tr":"viṉ"}]}],[{"text":"சாரல்","tr":"cāral","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சா","tr":"cā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரல்","tr":"ral"}]},{"text":"நாட","tr":"nāṭa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ட","tr":"ṭa"}]},{"text":"செவ்வியை","tr":"cevviyai","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"செவ்","tr":"cev"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வியை","tr":"viyai"}]},{"text":"ஆகுமதி","tr":"ākumati","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஆ","tr":"ā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கும","tr":"kuma"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தி","tr":"ti"}]}],[{"text":"யாரஃ","tr":"yāraḵ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரஃ","tr":"raḵ"}]},{"text":"தறிந்திசி","tr":"taṟintici","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தறிந்","tr":"taṟin"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"திசி","tr":"tici"}]},{"text":"னோரே","tr":"ṉōrē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"னோ","tr":"ṉō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரே","tr":"rē"}]},{"text":"சாரல்","tr":"cāral","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"சா","tr":"cā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரல்","tr":"ral"}]}],[{"text":"சிறுகோட்டுப்","tr":"ciṟukōṭṭup","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிறு","tr":"ciṟu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கோட்","tr":"kōṭ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டுப்","tr":"ṭup"}]},{"text":"பெரும்பழந்","tr":"perumpaḻan","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெரும்","tr":"perum"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பழந்","tr":"paḻan"}]},{"text":"தூங்கி","tr":"tūṅki","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தூங்","tr":"tūṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கி","tr":"ki"}]},{"text":"யாங்கிவள்","tr":"yāṅkivaḷ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யாங்","tr":"yāṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"கிவள்","tr":"kivaḷ"}]}],[{"text":"உயிர்தவச்","tr":"uyirtavac","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"உயிர்","tr":"uyir"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தவச்","tr":"tavac"}]},{"text":"சிறிது","tr":"ciṟitu","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"சிறி","tr":"ciṟi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]},{"text":"காமமோ","tr":"kāmamō","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"மமோ","tr":"mamō"}]},{"text":"பெரிதே","tr":"peritē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பெரி","tr":"peri"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"வேரல்","parts":[{"text":"வேரல்","lemma":"வேரல்","gloss":"small bamboo"}],"gloss":"small bamboo"},{"surface":"வேலி","parts":[{"text":"வேலி","lemma":"வேலி","gloss":"fence"}],"gloss":"fence"},{"surface":"வேர்க்கோள்","parts":[{"text":"வேர்","lemma":"வேர்","gloss":"root"},{"text":"கோள்","lemma":"கோள்","gloss":"bearing"}],"gloss":"bearing fruit at the root"},{"surface":"பலவின்","parts":[{"text":"பலவு","lemma":"பலா","gloss":"jackfruit tree"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of (genitive/oblique)"}],"gloss":"of the jackfruit tree"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சாரல்","parts":[{"text":"சாரல்","lemma":"சாரல்","gloss":"mountain slope"}],"gloss":"mountain slope"},{"surface":"நாட","parts":[{"text":"நாடு","lemma":"நாடு","gloss":"land"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"vocative suffix"}],"gloss":"O lord of the land!"},{"surface":"செவ்வியை","parts":[{"text":"செவ்வி","lemma":"செவ்வி","gloss":"fitness/opportunity"},{"text":"ஐ","lemma":"ஐ","gloss":"you (second person singular suffix)"}],"gloss":"you have the opportunity / you are of fitting nature"},{"surface":"ஆகுமதி","parts":[{"text":"ஆகு","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"become"},{"text":"மதி","lemma":"மதி","gloss":"exhortative particle"}],"gloss":"may you become"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யார்","parts":[{"text":"யார்","lemma":"யார்","gloss":"who"}],"gloss":"who"},{"surface":"அஃது","parts":[{"text":"அஃது","lemma":"அஃது","gloss":"that"}],"gloss":"that"},{"surface":"அறிந்திசினோரே","parts":[{"text":"அறி","lemma":"அறி","gloss":"know"},{"text":"ந்த்","lemma":"ந்த்","gloss":"past tense"},{"text":"இசின்","lemma":"இசின்","gloss":"past/euphonic particle"},{"text":"ஓர்","lemma":"ஓர்","gloss":"they/those who"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"those who know"},{"surface":"சாரல்","parts":[{"text":"சாரல்","lemma":"சாரல்","gloss":"mountain slope"}],"gloss":"mountain slope"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சிறுகோட்டு","parts":[{"text":"சிறுகோட்டு","lemma":"சிறுகோட்டு","gloss":"on the small branch"}],"gloss":"on the small branch","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பெரும்பழம்","parts":[{"text":"பெருமை","lemma":"பெருமை","gloss":"large/great"},{"text":"பழம்","lemma":"பழம்","gloss":"fruit"}],"gloss":"large fruit"},{"surface":"தூங்கி","parts":[{"text":"தூங்கு","lemma":"தூங்கு","gloss":"hang"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"verbal participle suffix"}],"gloss":"hanging"},{"surface":"ஆங்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஆங்கு","lemma":"ஆங்கு","gloss":"like/there"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"இவள்","parts":[{"text":"இவள்","lemma":"இவள்","gloss":"this woman"}],"gloss":"this woman"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உயிர்","parts":[{"text":"உயிர்","lemma":"உயிர்","gloss":"life"}],"gloss":"life"},{"surface":"தவ","parts":[{"text":"தவ","lemma":"தவ","gloss":"very much"}],"gloss":"very"},{"surface":"சிறிது","parts":[{"text":"சிறிது","lemma":"சிறிது","gloss":"small"}],"gloss":"is small"},{"surface":"காமமோ","parts":[{"text":"காமம்","lemma":"காமம்","gloss":"love/desire"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"emphasis/interrogative"}],"gloss":"but her love"},{"surface":"பெரிதே","parts":[{"text":"பெரிது","lemma":"பெரிது","gloss":"large/great"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"is indeed great"}]}],"literal":"Small bamboo fence, root-bearing jackfruit tree's / mountain slope lord! May you become of fitting nature! / Who are those who know that? Mountain slope / on a small branch a large fruit hanging, like that, this woman's / life is very small, but her love is indeed great!","translation":"O lord of the mountain slopes, where small bamboo serves as a fence and jackfruit trees bear fruit right at their roots! May you act with fitting grace. Who is there to understand her state? Like a huge fruit hanging from a tiny branch on the mountain slope, her life is very small, but her love is immense.","modern":"சிறிய மூங்கில்களை வேலியாகக் கொண்ட, வேரிலேயே பலாப்பழங்கள் காய்க்கும் மலைச்சரிவு நாட்டின் தலைவனே! நீ அவளை விரைந்து மணந்து கொள்ளும் நல்வாய்ப்பைப் பெறுவாயாக! அவளுடைய நிலையை யார்தான் அறிவார்கள்? மலைச்சரிவில் உள்ள ஒரு சிறிய கிளையிலே பெரிய பலாப்பழம் தொங்குவதைப் போல, இவளுடைய உயிர் மிகவும் சிறியது; ஆனால் இவள் உன்மேல் கொண்டுள்ள காதலோ மிகப் பெரியது.","explanation":"The friend (தோழி) is speaking to the hero (தலைவன்) who has been coming secretly to meet the heroine (தலைவி). She urges him to marry her soon instead of continuing his secret visits. She compares the heroine's delicate life to a tiny branch holding a massive jackfruit. This imagery belongs to the Kuriñci (mountainous) landscape. The tiny branch represents the heroine's fragile life, while the heavy fruit represents her overwhelming love. If the hero delays marriage, her life might break under the weight of her love, just as the branch might snap under the weight of the fruit. Key words include 'சிறுகோடு' (small branch), 'பெரும்பழம்' (large fruit), 'உயிர்' (life), and 'காமம்' (love).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.8],[0.8,1.2],[1.2,1.4],[1.4,2.07],[2.07,2.51],[2.51,3.4],[3.4,3.9],[3.9,4.64],[4.64,5.87],[5.87,6.36],[6.36,7.1],[7.1,7.9],[7.9,8.7],[8.7,9.1],[9.1,9.8],[9.8,10.93],[10.93,11.5],[11.5,12.0],[12.0,12.5]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,1.2],[1.2,1.5],[1.5,2.2],[2.2,2.67],[2.67,3.6],[3.6,4.1],[4.1,5.0],[5.0,6.5],[6.5,7.1],[7.1,7.6],[7.6,8.45],[8.45,9.3],[9.3,9.8],[9.8,10.6],[10.6,11.8],[11.8,12.4],[12.4,12.9],[12.9,13.4]]},"sync":[[["வேரல்","small bamboo"]],[["வேலி","fence"]],[["வேர்க்கோள்","bearing fruit at the root"]],[["பலவின்","of the jackfruit tree"]],[["சாரல்","mountain slope"]],[["நாட","O lord of the land!"]],[["செவ்வியை","you have the opportunity / you are of fitting nature"]],[["ஆகுமதி","may you become"]],[["யார்","who"],["அஃது","that"]],[["அஃது","that"],["அறிந்திசினோரே","those who know"]],[["அறிந்திசினோரே","those who know"]],[["சாரல்","mountain slope"]],[["சிறுகோட்டு","on the small branch"],["பெரும்பழம்","large fruit"]],[["பெரும்பழம்","large fruit"]],[["தூங்கி","hanging"]],[["ஆங்கு","like"],["இவள்","this woman"]],[["உயிர்","life"],["தவ","very"]],[["சிறிது","is small"]],[["காமமோ","but her love"]],[["பெரிதே","is indeed great"]]]}